ss=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-qlodmwvz\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-x0rci7fa uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h3 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">Our Trusted DEFRA-Approved Pet Transport Partners – How to Get a Puppy Delivered</h3></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-separator\"></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p>Ensuring our blue Staffy puppies’ utmost safety and well-being during transit is our highest priority as UK blue Staffy breeders. That’s why we exclusively partner with DEFRA-approved pet transport services. These professional carriers adhere to stringent safe pet transport UK welfare standards, providing safe and comfortable journeys for your new family member.</p>\n<p></p>\n</div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-button-wrapper wp-block-button\"><a class=\"uagb-infobox-cta-link wp-block-button__link\" href=\"#contact-form\" onclick=\"return true;\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"uagb-inline-editing\">How Puppy Transport Works</span><svg viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M504.3 273.6l-112.1 104c-6.992 6.484-17.18 8.218-25.94 4.406c-8.758-3.812-14.42-12.45-14.42-21.1L351.9 288H32C14.33 288 .0002 273.7 .0002 255.1S14.33 224 32 224h319.9l0-72c0-9.547 5.66-18.19 14.42-22c8.754-3.809 18.95-2.075 25.94 4.41l112.1 104C514.6 247.9 514.6 264.1 504.3 273.6z\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-box uagb-block-nir2jlj9 uagb-infobox__content-wrap uagb-infobox-icon-above-title uagb-infobox-image-valign-top\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-content\"><div class=\"uagb-ifb-title-wrap\"><h4 class=\"uagb-ifb-title\">While we manage the booking and coordination, we work with reputable services that you can also learn more about:</h4></div><div class=\"uagb-ifb-desc\">\n<p><strong>Super Pet Travel: </strong>A highly recommended carrier known for its professional and caring approach.<br/><br/><strong>The Pet Bus:</strong> Specialists in secure and comfortable pet transportation across the UK.<br/><br/><strong>PetsA2B:</strong> Offering reliable and efficient pet relocation services.<br/><br/><strong>Move My Pet:</strong> Dedicated to safe and stress-free pet travel.<br/><br/><strong>Exec Pets:</strong> Providing premium and secure pet transport solutions.<br/><br/>We meticulously select the best option for each puppy’s journey, guaranteeing a smooth and safe arrival at your doorstep.</p>\n<p>Our shipping process is meticulously planned to ensure the comfort and safety of our puppies throughout their journey. We partner with trusted and experienced DEFRA-approved pet transport services who prioritize the well-being of our puppies every step of the way, ensuring a stress-free transition for your new companion. While shipping costs vary, we’ll provide clear details during your inquiry process.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/uk-locations/blue-staffy-puppies-uk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>See All Our UK Service Areas</strong></a></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-08wlhsqj alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-advanced-heading uagb-block-czdauzbn\"><h2 class=\"uagb-heading-text\"><strong>Your Questions About Blue Staffies, Answered</strong></h2><p class=\"uagb-desc-text\">Considering welcoming a blue Staffy puppy into your Glasgow, Scotland home or anywhere across the UK? We’ve compiled answers to the most frequently asked questions by our families. Find quick insights and comprehensive <strong><a href=\"/blue-staffy-blog-guides/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Staffy care and breed guides</a></strong> below.</p></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq uagb-faq__outer-wrap uagb-block-z1bvdxhp uagb-faq-icon-row-reverse uagb-faq-layout-accordion uagb-faq-expand-first-false uagb-faq-inactive-other-true uagb-faq__wrap uagb-buttons-layout-wrap uagb-faq-equal-height\" role=\"tablist\"><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-m73rpq2t\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>Are Blue Staffies good family pets, especially with children?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Absolutely! Blue Staffies are renowned for their affectionate, loyal, and gentle nature, often earning them the nickname “the children’s nursemaid.” As one of the top breeds when it comes to family compatibility, the <strong>Staffordshire Bull Terrier is good with kids</strong>, especially when properly socialized and trained. They form incredibly strong bonds with their families and are known for their patience and fondness for children.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-vggptkai\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What health tests do you perform on your Blue Staffy breeding dogs?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We prioritize the health of our <strong>blue Staffy puppies</strong>. All our breeding dogs undergo thorough health screening for breed-specific conditions, including L-2-HGA (Hereditary Cataracts) and HC-HSF4 (Hereditary Cataracts – Hereditary Clear). We ensure our pups get the healthiest possible start in life.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-imgl1wej\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What is included when I buy a Blue Staffy puppy from BlueStaffyUK.uk?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>Each of our <strong>blue Staffy puppies</strong> comes with a comprehensive puppy package, typically including their first vaccinations, microchip, a full veterinary health check, deworming/defleaing, relevant paperwork (such as pedigree information), and a puppy pack to help them settle into their new home. We also offer lifelong support and advice. </p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-f53do2hh\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>How do you ensure the safe delivery of Staffies across the UK?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>We partner with trusted, DEFRA-approved pet transport services experienced in nationwide puppy delivery. We meticulously plan each journey to ensure your <strong>blue Staffy puppy’s</strong> comfort, safety, and a stress-free transition from our home to yours, anywhere in the UK.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-dcwdxabe\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What is the typical price range for a Blue Staffy puppy from BlueStaffyUK.uk?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p>The <strong>price of our blue Staffy puppies</strong> reflects our commitment to ethical breeding, comprehensive health testing, quality care, and extensive early socialization. While blue Staffy price UK can vary slightly based on specific lineage and characteristics, we aim to provide exceptional value for a healthy, well-adjusted blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier. Please check the available litter section for the current cost of our Staffy puppies.</p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-za3rrxeu\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong>What kind of support do you offer to new <strong>blue staffy</strong> buyers?</strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p><strong>We are dedicated to providing ongoing support and guidance to new buyers. We offer advice on care, training, nutrition, and any questions you may have as you welcome your blue Staffy into your home. We are always here to help you and your new companion.</strong></p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-184eb6ce\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong><strong><strong>Do you offer health guarantees for your <strong>blue staffy puppies</strong>?</strong></strong></strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p><strong><strong>Yes, we stand behind the health of our Blue Staffy puppies. We offer a health guarantee that covers certain congenital and hereditary conditions. Please visit our Health &amp; Care page for detailed information on our health testing and guarantees.</strong></strong></p></div></div><div class=\"wp-block-uagb-faq-child uagb-faq-child__outer-wrap uagb-faq-item uagb-block-5b86c301\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\"><div class=\"uagb-faq-questions-button uagb-faq-questions\"> <span class=\"uagb-icon uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M432 256c0 17.69-14.33 32.01-32 32.01H256v144c0 17.69-14.33 31.99-32 31.99s-32-14.3-32-31.99v-144H48c-17.67 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.33-31.99 32-31.99H192v-144c0-17.69 14.33-32.01 32-32.01s32 14.32 32 32.01v144h144C417.7 224 432 238.3 432 256z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<span class=\"uagb-icon-active uagb-faq-icon-wrap\">\n<svg viewbox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"https://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M400 288h-352c-17.69 0-32-14.32-32-32.01s14.31-31.99 32-31.99h352c17.69 0 32 14.3 32 31.99S417.7 288 400 288z\"></path></svg>\n</span>\n<p class=\"uagb-question\"><strong><strong><strong>Where can I find blue staffy breeders in the UK?</strong></strong></strong></p></div><div class=\"uagb-faq-content\"><p><strong><strong>BlueStaffyUK.uk is a trusted source for ethically bred blue Staffordshire Bull Terrier puppies across the United Kingdom, with a strong focus on health and temperament.</strong></strong></p></div></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-4frlkjdp alignfull uagb-is-root-container\"><div class=\"uagb-container-inner-blocks-wrap\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image alignleft uagb-block-bprqrbip wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-left\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img alt=\"KC registered blue Staffy puppies cuddling with child in London home\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 760px\" src=\"/images/kc-registered-blue-staffy-pups-london.webp\" srcset=\"/images/kc-registered-blue-staffy-pups-london.webp 640w\" width=\"640\"/></figure></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-container uagb-block-nbzzyj2r\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-info-b